---
import LegalPage from "../components/legal/legal-page.astro";

const toc = [
  { id: "overview", title: "Overview & Data Controller" },
  { id: "data-we-collect", title: "Information We Collect" },
  { id: "how-we-use-data", title: "How We Use Your Data" },
  { id: "data-sharing", title: "Data Sharing & Third Parties" },
  { id: "media-recordings", title: "Livestreaming & Media Recordings" },
  { id: "security-retention", title: "Data Security & Retention" },
  { id: "your-rights", title: "Your Rights (UU PDP)" },
  { id: "policy-changes", title: "Changes to This Policy" },
  { id: "contact", title: "Contact Information" },
];
---

<LegalPage
  title="Privacy Policy"
  subtitle="How PERKODI collects, uses, and protects personal data for IDSW 2026 in compliance with Indonesian Data Protection Law (UU PDP)."
  toc={toc}
  currentPath="/privacy-policy">
  <div class="rounded-xl border border-blue-200 bg-blue-50/60 p-5 text-sm text-blue-950">
    <p class="font-semibold text-blue-900 mb-1">Our Privacy Commitment</p>
    <p class="text-blue-900/90 leading-relaxed">
      PERKODI respects your personal privacy. We collect and process personal data exclusively for organizing,
      administering, and delivering IDSW 2026. We never sell personal data to advertisers or third-party brokers.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Section 1: Overview -->
  <section id="overview" class="scroll-mt-28 space-y-3">
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 border-b border-neutral-100 pb-2">
      1. Overview & Data Controller
    </h2>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
      This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>Perkumpulan Pengrajin Kode Indonesia (PERKODI)</strong> (“PERKODI”, “we”, “us”,
      or “our”) acts as the data controller for personal data collected in connection with <strong
        >Indonesia Software Developer Conference (IDSW 2026)</strong
      > and its official website (<a href="https://idsw.dev" class="text-primary underline">idsw.dev</a>).
    </p>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
      Our data processing practices comply with <strong
        >Law of the Republic of Indonesia No. 27 of 2022 on Personal Data Protection (Undang-Undang Perlindungan Data
        Pribadi / UU PDP)</strong
      > and applicable electronic transaction regulations.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 2: Information We Collect -->
  <section id="data-we-collect" class="scroll-mt-28 space-y-3">
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 border-b border-neutral-100 pb-2">
      2. Information We Collect
    </h2>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
      Depending on your participation in IDSW 2026 (as an attendee, speaker, or partner), we may collect:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-700">
      <li>
        <strong>Identification & Contact Data:</strong> Name, email address, phone number, and company or organization (if
        provided).
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Ticketing & Attendance Records:</strong> Ticket tier and order reference. Payment transactions are processed
        directly by our ticketing partner (TipTip); PERKODI does not store payment card or banking details.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Speaker & CFP Submissions:</strong> Speaker biography, photo, presentation titles, abstracts, slides, and
        technical topic areas.
      </li>
      <li><strong>Communications:</strong> Inquiries, feedback, and correspondence sent to our organizing team.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 3: How We Use Your Data -->
  <section id="how-we-use-data" class="scroll-mt-28 space-y-3">
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 border-b border-neutral-100 pb-2">
      3. How We Use Your Data
    </h2>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
      We use personal data strictly for event management purposes:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-700">
      <li>Managing registration, ticketing, and check-in at the venue.</li>
      <li>Communicating important event updates, schedules, and logistical announcements.</li>
      <li>Reviewing and coordinating Call for Proposals (CFP) submissions and speaker schedules.</li>
      <li>Publishing speaker names, profile bios, and talk details on the official conference schedule.</li>
      <li>Responding to inquiries, support requests, and Code of Conduct reports.</li>
      <li>Complying with applicable legal obligations under Indonesian law.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 4: Data Sharing & Third Parties -->
  <section id="data-sharing" class="scroll-mt-28 space-y-3">
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 border-b border-neutral-100 pb-2">
      4. Data Sharing & Third Parties
    </h2>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
      We do not sell personal data. We share limited data only with trusted third parties where strictly necessary:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-700">
      <li>
        <strong>Ticketing Partner (TipTip):</strong> To manage ticket issuance and validate check-in at the event.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Livestreaming Platforms:</strong> To deliver real-time session streaming and digital archives for participants.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Legal Compliance:</strong> When required by Indonesian statutory law, court orders, or official regulatory
        requests.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 5: Livestreaming & Media Recordings -->
  <section id="media-recordings" class="scroll-mt-28 space-y-3">
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 border-b border-neutral-100 pb-2">
      5. Livestreaming & Media Recordings
    </h2>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
      By attending IDSW 2026, participants consent to image, audio, and video recordings of sessions:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-700">
      <li>Recordings may be used for live streaming, archives, or promotional purposes on official channels.</li>
      <li>
        Event photos or videos featuring attendees may be used for marketing and archival purposes. Participants are
        deemed to consent unless they opt out in writing beforehand.
      </li>
      <li>
        If participants prefer not to be recorded or photographed, they must notify organizers in advance via <a
          href="mailto:idsw.ticketing@perkodi.org"
          class="text-primary underline">idsw.ticketing@perkodi.org</a
        >.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 6: Data Security & Retention -->
  <section id="security-retention" class="scroll-mt-28 space-y-3">
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 border-b border-neutral-100 pb-2">
      6. Data Security & Retention
    </h2>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
      We implement reasonable organizational and technical measures to protect your personal data from unauthorized
      access, loss, or misuse.
    </p>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
      Personal data is retained only as long as necessary for event administration and statutory compliance, after which
      it will be securely deleted or anonymized.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 7: Your Rights -->
  <section id="your-rights" class="scroll-mt-28 space-y-3">
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 border-b border-neutral-100 pb-2">
      7. Your Rights Under Indonesian Law (UU PDP)
    </h2>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
      Under Law No. 27/2022 on Personal Data Protection (UU PDP), you have the right to:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-700">
      <li>Access and obtain information about how your personal data is processed.</li>
      <li>Request correction or updates to inaccurate personal data.</li>
      <li>Request deletion or destruction of your personal data when no longer required.</li>
      <li>Withdraw prior consent for communications.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 pt-2">
      To exercise these rights, please contact us at <a
        href="mailto:idsw.ticketing@perkodi.org"
        class="text-primary underline">idsw.ticketing@perkodi.org</a
      >.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 8: Policy Changes -->
  <section id="policy-changes" class="scroll-mt-28 space-y-3">
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 border-b border-neutral-100 pb-2">
      8. Changes to This Policy
    </h2>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
      We may update this Privacy Policy periodically to reflect operational changes or applicable legal requirements.
      Updates will be published on <a href="https://idsw.dev/privacy-policy" class="text-primary underline"
        >idsw.dev/privacy-policy</a
      >.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 9: Contact -->
  <section id="contact" class="scroll-mt-28 space-y-3">
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 border-b border-neutral-100 pb-2">
      9. Contact Information
    </h2>
    <p class="text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
      If you have questions, privacy concerns, or wish to exercise your rights as a data subject, please contact:
    </p>
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 p-5 text-sm text-neutral-700">
      <p class="font-semibold text-neutral-900">PERKUMPULAN PENGRAJIN KODE INDONESIA (PERKODI)</p>
      <p class="mt-1">IDSW 2026</p>
      <p class="mt-2">
        Email: <a href="mailto:idsw.ticketing@perkodi.org" class="text-primary font-semibold underline"
          >idsw.ticketing@perkodi.org</a
        >
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</LegalPage>
